<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia flat, seasonal buying light.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia flat, seasonal buying light.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP prices were flat Friday in lackluster activity, dealers said.</p>
<p>Producers have not yet begun to buy to fill spring planting needs, and trade has been limited this week, cash sources said.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   176-177		    unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     186-188		    unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		220		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
